"1647397519211046", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823447_1647397522544379_7242525253114032672_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bIQS1SbgI8UQ7kNvwHY4jaD&_nc_oc=AdqvQQLa7eFcg7s9ZSy55dAIXCteJ7VENR9EOyxLIDldS1Or11lyFDIC1Uyw_Hl0Y84&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS7ZqKwQrQw4rv8A8WrEsGuIT4HeAulznJUKtVH1cLCQQ&oe=6B0D9FD3"}, {"file_name": "AimAssaultScreenshot_3.png", "id": "1042516971283635", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618038_1042516977950301_7127956922843357683_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5G-2GIkz-AIQ7kNvwFLeqzs&_nc_oc=AdrbBk2j-gSO7FDNNFsMxd0yY6SFBQ3grs88rtn-sit8O0J3qE2AnnIQwF_gId0Zzlk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTR1e7clkQ0W1OWckGBdcQmx_qY_ijTxDYz6Z1RjVeqnA&oe=6B0DCBB8"}, {"file_name": "AimAssaultScreenshot_7.png", "id": "1258289705921377", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819980_1258289709254710_5517956587707328170_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xh1r6S-19GUQ7kNvwGrHgba&_nc_oc=AdogNWYoN1cIXtQxgY0RLwwebwAIuwjqJ1SglRXqCKzdVFOFa4L1tLrYR7d9Xh2V2Mw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQUYM5EaEPVhQv9KUJPk9ZUGuukTHCYvsUezDZSmPSD-g&oe=6B0DA70B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverVideo copy.png", "id": "745003004781662", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828899_745003008114995_1490029844351575801_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1R7PIzplQPsQ7kNvwGZ4szT&_nc_oc=AdptxHH3bUxiBwojzlrPzDndmLSrOnT34ba2VfIaAJ1phgh79ljMPqMV2rwWN6N43_M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQlgGaIsfyoxzkIiHMtezMZj1Wy0oXkxzqJCeh9dU5ARA&oe=6B0DA0EC"}, "display_name": "Aim Assault Demo", "keywords": ["arcade", "shooter", "retro", "rail", "action"], "long_description": "**GET FULL VERSION: https://www.meta.com/experiences/aim-assault/24713300634926906/**\n\nAim Assault brings good old arcade rail-shooter into the world of virtual reality. Relive the excitement of old-school arcade games now in VR. Try out various gunplay styles - single gun, dual wielding, with or without a crosshair. Race against the clock and try to beat your personal score or compete in the global leaderboards. Fight different types of enemies in intense situations and everchanging rich environments. Dodge barrages of bullets, kill the bad guys and save the world. \n\n{1109498334375581}\n\nPlay the Training, Villa and Villa Night missions for free. Immerse yourself in the action-packed VR rail shooter, full of shooting, dodging bullets, and fighting villains.\n\nWant more? Unlock more content right in the demo with in-app purchases. Every pack also adds new weapons and gun colors:\n- **Airplane Pack:** 3 missions\n- **Daughter Pack:** 3 missions\n- **Hawk Boss Fight** and **Jaguar Boss Fight**\n- **Aim Rush:** 2 aim training modes\n- **Supporter Pack:** everything in one purchase\n\n{948482724042529}\n\n\"VR gave us a rare opportunity to recreate the arcade shooters we all loved as kids in a new way. Because of VR, we have new tools to immerse players even more into a game full of action.\" - Jakub Kucera (Game Director)\n\n{1951700829016520}\n\nDiscord\nWe regularly announce new locations, enemy types, bosses, and game mechanics on our Discord. Share your thoughts on the demo with us.\n\nWelcome to the world of Aim Assault!\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "GET FULL VERSION: https://www.meta.com/experiences/aim-assault/24713300634926906/\nAim Assault brings classic arcade shooters into the world of virtual reality. Dodge a storm of bullets, take down hordes of enemies, and save the world. Play three missions for free and unlock more with in-app purchases."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.co